 "blurb": "Rim forests, desert slopes, and the scavengers that ride the canyon air.",
 "tip": {
  "id": "fire",
  "title": "Take away fire",
  "text": "Frequent low fires keep ponderosa forest open and its grasses growing. Set Low-intensity fire to -100% and watch the pines and grasses, then the elk, deer and bighorn that graze there."
 },
